{"sourceUrl":"https://coe.ouc.edu.cn/2026/0916/c8976a537279/page.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:54:18.503721+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://coe.ouc.edu.cn/2026/0916/c8976a537279/page.htm","html":"<div><p></p><p><br/></p><p><span><strong>一、组织领导</strong></span></p><p><span>（一）学部、学院（中心）研究生招生工作小组负责组织实施本单位综合考核工作，指导、监督检查各学科（类别）、专业（领域）考核小组开展考核工作。</span></p><p><span>（二）各学科专业成立综合考核小组（小组成员一般不少于</span><span>5</span><span>人），在招生工作小组指导下具体实施考核工作，负责确定考生各考核环节的具体内容、评分标准及程序等。</span></p><p><span><strong>二、资格审核</strong></span></p><p><span>（一）综合考核确认</span></p><p><span>9</span><span>月</span><span>16</span><span>日前，学院将对报名材料进行审核，择优确定进入综合考核的名单。审核结果将于</span><span><span>9</span></span><span><span>月</span></span><span><span><span>15-</span></span></span><span><span>16</span></span><span><span><span><span>日</span></span><span>通过</span><span><strong>邮件通知</strong></span><span>审核通过的考生。获准参加综合考核的考生，请</span><span><span>最晚</span></span><span>于</span></span></span><span><strong>9</strong></span><span><strong>月</strong></span><span><strong>17</strong></span><span><strong>日</strong></span><span><strong>12:00</strong></span><span><span><span><strong>前</strong></span><span>回复邮件</span><span><span>（以邮件为准）</span></span><span>，确认是否参加对应专业面试；未按时完成相应程序的申请者，视为自动放弃。综合考核前，学院将进一步核验考生身份信息，请考生提前准备好身份证件以备查验。</span></span></span></p><p><span>（二）入校方式</span></p><p><span>考生综合考核资格确认后，下载并填写《中国海洋大学</span><span>2027</span><span>年推荐免试研究生综合考核通知单》（见附件），凭《通知单》经校门工作人员核验后入校参加复试。</span></p><p><span>（三）综合考核报到</span></p><p><span><span><span>报到时间：各考生务必</span><span><span>于</span></span><span><span><strong>对应专业面试当天早上</strong></span></span></span></span><span><span><strong>8:00</strong></span></span><span><span><span><span>前</span></span><span>到达面试等候室</span><span><span>，</span></span><span>进行</span><span><span>材料核验与</span></span><span>思想政治素质和品德考核。</span></span></span></p><p><span>报到所需材料：考生本人身份证和学校预报名系统上传的含签字盖章的申请材料原件。</span></p><p><span><strong>三、综合考核</strong></span></p><p><span>（一）综合考核方式</span></p><p><span>采取现场复试。工程学院地址：青岛市黄岛区三沙路</span><span>1299</span><span>号中国海洋大学西海岸校区（西区）工程楼。</span></p><p><span>（二）综合考核内容</span></p><p><span>1.</span><span>外国语听力及口语能力。主要考核考生是否达到本学科专业的外语要求，包括听力和口语测试。</span></p><p><span>2.</span><span>专业素质和能力。全面考核考生对本学科专业理论知识和应用技能掌握程度，利用所学理论发现、分析和解决问题的能力，对本学科发展动态的了解以及在本专业领域发展的潜力。</span></p><p><span>3.</span><span>综合素质和能力。本学科专业以外的学习、科研、社会实践（学生工作、社团活动、志愿服务等）或实际工作表现等方面的情况；事业心、责任感、纪律性（遵纪守法）、协作性和心理健康情况；创新精神和创新能力；人文素养、举止、表达和礼仪等。</span></p><p><span>（三）思想政治素质和品德考核。</span></p><p><span>1. </span><span><span><span>考核时间：</span><span><strong>各专业面试</strong></span><span><span><strong>当天早上</strong></span></span></span></span><span><span><strong>8:00</strong></span></span><span>。</span></p><p><span>2. </span><span>考核地点：各专业面试等候室。</span></p><p><span>3. </span><span>考核内容：包括考生的政治态度、思想表现、道德品质、遵纪守法、诚实守信等方面。考生参加思想政治考查，填写《中国海洋大学工程学院思想政治考核表》。</span></p><p><span>（四）综合考核安排</span></p><table><tbody><tr><td><p><span><strong>类型</strong></span></p></td><td><p><span><strong>专业代码</strong></span></p></td><td><p><span><strong>专业名称</strong></span><span><span><strong>/</strong></span><span><strong>研究方向</strong></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><strong>面试时间</strong></span></p></td><td><p><span><strong>面试地点</strong></span></p></td><td><p><span><strong>等候地点</strong></span></p></td></tr></tbody><tbody><tr><td><p><span>直博</span></p></td><td><p><span>081500</span></p><p><span>082400</span></p><p><span>085700</span></p><p><span>085900</span></p></td><td><p><span>水利工程</span></p><p><span>船舶与海洋工程</span></p><p><span>资源与环境</span></p><p><span>土木水利</span></p></td><td><p><span><span>9</span><span>月</span></span><span><span>20</span><span>日</span></span><span><span>8</span><span>：</span></span><span>30</span></p></td><td><p><span>A433</span></p></td><td><p><span>A331</span></p></td></tr></tbody><tbody><tr><td rowspan=\"15\"><p><span>硕士</span></p></td><td><p><span>082401</span></p></td><td><p><span>船舶与海洋结构物设计制造</span></p></td><td><p><span><span>9</span><span>月</span></span><span><span>20</span><span>日</span></span><span><span>8</span><span>：</span></span><span>30</span></p></td><td><p><span>A524</span></p></td><td><p><span>A331</span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>085903</span></p></td><td><p><span>海洋工程</span></p></td><td><p><span><span>9</span><span>月</span></span><span><span>20</span><span>日</span></span><span><span>8</span><span>：</span></span><span>30</span></p></td><td><p><span>A520</span></p></td><td><p><span>A331</span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>081501</span></p></td><td><p><span>水文学及水资源</span></p></td><td><p><span><span>9</span><span>月</span></span><span><span>20</span><span>日</span></span><span><span>8</span><span>：</span></span><span>30</span></p></td><td><p><span>B432</span></p></td><td><p><span>A331</span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>081505</span></p></td><td><p><span>港口、海岸及近海工程</span></p></td><td><p><span><span>9</span><span>月</span></span><span><span>20</span><span>日</span></span><span><span>8</span><span>：</span></span><span>30</span></p></td><td><p><span>A553</span></p></td><td><p><span>A331</span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>0815Z1</span></p></td><td><p><span>海洋能利用技术</span></p></td><td><p><span><span>9</span><span>月</span></span><span><span>20</span><span>日</span></span><span><span>8</span><span>：</span></span><span>30</span></p></td><td><p><span>B432</span></p></td><td><p><span>A331</span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>085902</span></p></td><td><p><span>水利工程</span></p></td><td><p><span><span>9</span><span>月</span></span><span><span>20</span><span>日</span></span><span><span>8</span><span>：</span></span><span>30</span></p></td><td><p><span>B432</span></p></td><td><p><span>A331</span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>085901</span></p></td><td><p><span>土木工程</span></p></td><td><p><span><span>9</span><span>月</span></span><span><span>18</span><span>日</span></span><span><span>8</span><span>：</span></span><span>30</span></p><p><span><span>9</span><span>月</span></span><span><span>19</span><span>日</span></span><span><span>8</span><span>：</span></span><span>30</span></p></td><td><p><span>B438</span></p></td><td><p><span>B418</span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>080200</span></p></td><td><p><span>机械工程</span></p></td><td><p><span><span>9</span><span>月</span></span><span><span>19</span><span>日</span></span><span><span>8</span><span>：</span></span><span>30</span></p></td><td><p><span>B329</span></p></td><td><p><span>B333</span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>082402</span></p></td><td><p><span>轮机工程</span></p></td><td><p><span><span>9</span><span>月</span></span><span><span>19</span><span>日</span></span><span><span>8</span><span>：</span></span><span>30</span></p></td><td><p><span>B210</span></p></td><td><p><span>B201</span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>085501</span></p></td><td><p><span>机械工程</span></p></td><td><p><span><span>9</span><span>月</span></span><span><span>19</span><span>日</span></span><span><span>8</span><span>：</span></span><span>30</span></p></td><td><p><span>B326</span></p></td><td><p><span>B333</span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>085505</span></p></td><td><p><span>船舶工程</span></p></td><td><p><span><span>9</span><span>月</span></span><span><span>19</span><span>日</span></span><span><span>8</span><span>：</span></span><span>30</span></p></td><td><p><span>B210</span></p></td><td><p><span>B201</span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>085507</span></p></td><td><p><span>工业设计工程</span></p></td><td><p><span><span>9</span><span>月</span></span><span><span>18</span><span>日</span></span><span><span>8</span><span>：</span></span><span>30</span></p></td><td><p><span>B310</span></p></td><td><p><span>B301</span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>085802</span></p></td><td><p><span>动力工程</span></p></td><td><p><span><span>9</span><span>月</span></span><span><span>19</span><span>日</span></span><span><span>8</span><span>：</span></span><span>30</span></p></td><td><p><span>B310</span></p></td><td><p><span>B301</span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>081100</span></p></td><td><p><span>控制科学与工程</span></p></td><td><p><span><span>9</span><span>月</span></span><span><span>18</span><span>日</span></span><span><span>8</span><span>：</span></span><span>30</span></p><p><span><span>9</span><span>月</span></span><span><span>19</span><span>日</span></span><span><span>8</span><span>：</span></span><span>30</span></p></td><td><p><span>A208</span></p></td><td><p><span>A202</span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>085406</span></p></td><td><p><span>控制工程</span></p></td><td><p><span><span>9</span><span>月</span></span><span><span>18</span><span>日</span></span><span><span>8</span><span>：</span></span><span>30</span></p><p><span><span>9</span><span>月</span></span><span><span>19</span><span>日</span></span><span><span>8</span><span>：</span></span><span>30</span></p></td><td><p><span>B428</span></p></td><td><p><span>A202</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p><span>考务人员会提前发邮件通知考生具体复试时间，请注意查收邮件。</span></p><p><span><strong>四、综合考核成绩</strong></span></p><p><span>综合考核成绩</span><span>=</span><span>专业素质和能力成绩</span><span>×50%+</span><span>综合素质和能力成绩</span><span>×30%+</span><span>外国语听力与口语测试成绩</span><span>×20%</span><span>。</span></p><p><span>综合考核结束后，学院将对考生成绩进行多次核算，并及时在本单位网站（</span><span>http://coe.ouc.edu.cn/</span><span>）公布考生成绩，公布时间不少于</span><span>3</span><span>天。</span></p><p><span>成绩公布期间如有异议，请及时与研究生秘书老师进行联系，联系方式：</span><span>0532-60895308</span><span>。</span></p><p><a href=\"https://coe.ouc.edu.cn/2026/0916/c8976a537279/page.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"></a><span><strong>五、综合考核结果</strong></span></p><p><span>1.</span><span>综合考核成绩不及格（</span><span>60</span><span>分以下）者不予录取，及格者择优录取。</span></p><p><span>2.</span><span>思想政治素质和品德考核不作量化计入总成绩，但不合格者不予录取。</span></p><p><span>3.</span><span>综合考核结果可登录“中国海洋大学研究生考生服务平台”查询，请及时关注学校相关通知。</span></p><p><span><strong>六、本方案由工程学院招生工作小组负责解释。</strong></span></p><p><span>未尽事宜，详见中国海洋大学研究生招生信息网相关通知。</span></p><p><span>咨询电话：</span><span>0532-60895308</span><span>，联系人：王老师</span></p><p><span>附件：</span><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://coe.ouc.edu.cn/_ueditor/themes/default/images/icon_doc.gif\"/><a href=\"https://coe.ouc.edu.cn/_upload/article/files/f3/02/d394d89649d1b16cbc97c657761a/4f24fc67-a6b9-4a6d-893e-8cddf3989389.docx\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">中国海洋大学2027年推荐免试研究生综合考核通知单.docx</a><span></span></p><p><br/></p><p><br/></p><p><span>工程学院</span></p><p><span>2026</span><span>年</span><span>9</span><span>月</span><span>16</span><span>日</span></p><p><br/></p></div>","textSha256":"ce7949cee47e6cf8bbad04f23a57c360d9e02c6afb16bc409531a9878d66d1c3","textLength":1954,"sourceSha256":"afc6c55bee8009661b6d9393a0771cacc0134001a7080f74e5f7a9ea2babcb23","selector":".wp_articlecontent","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-a4ef289c0f6e7cdf0c85","title":"2026年中国海洋大学工程学院接收推荐免试研究生（含直博生）综合考核工作实施细则","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:54:18.503721+00:00"}
